(real production function; no vitest, no mocks, no assertions)
sandboxRoot = <redacted temp sandbox root>

  [accept] media=/sandbox/out/photo.png  containerWorkdir=/sandbox
           -> <sandboxRoot>/out/photo.png

  [accept] media=file:///sandbox/out/photo.png  containerWorkdir=/sandbox
           -> <sandboxRoot>/out/photo.png

  [accept] media=/workspace/media/pic.png  containerWorkdir=(default /workspace)
           -> <sandboxRoot>/media/pic.png   (regression: default Docker /workspace still maps)

  [accept] media=/sandbox/out/photo.png  containerWorkdir=/sandbox/   (trailing slash normalized)
           -> <sandboxRoot>/out/photo.png

  [accept] media=/sandbox  containerWorkdir=/sandbox   (bare workdir -> root)
           -> <sandboxRoot>

  [reject] media=/sandboxer/secret  containerWorkdir=/sandbox   (prefix attack)
           -> Path escapes sandbox root: /sandboxer/secret

  [reject] media=/workspace/out/photo.png  containerWorkdir=/sandbox   (/workspace no longer maps when overridden)
           -> Path escapes sandbox root: /workspace/out/photo.png

  [reject] media=file:///workspace/out/photo.png  containerWorkdir=/sandbox
           -> Invalid file:// URL for sandboxed media (rejected at boundary)

  [reject] media=/sandbox/out/photo.png  containerWorkdir=/   (root-only "/" falls back to default /workspace; no empty-prefix over-match)
           -> Path escapes sandbox root: /sandbox/out/photo.png

--- Summary ---
  5 container media paths accepted (mapped into sandboxRoot)
  4 rejected at the sandbox-root boundary (prefix attack, /workspace override, root-only fallback)
```

